{'since_id': 5062123007248231, 'user_id': '1376804704', 'created_at': 'Wed Jul 31 16:22:12 +0800 2024', 'id': '5062234132975217', 'text': '<a  href="https://m.weibo.cn/p/index?extparam=%E7%BB%BF%E8%89%B2%E9%BE%99%E6%B1%9F&containerid=1008080c0c9b3087a6d8827ec7affe0d109cc2" data-hide=""><span class=\'url-icon\'><img style=\'width: 1rem;height: 1rem\' src=\'https://n.sinaimg.cn/photo/5213b46e/20180926/timeline_card_small_super_default.png\'></span><span class="surl-text">绿色龙江</span></a><span class="url-icon"><img alt="[收到]" src="https://face.t.sinajs.cn/t4/appstyle/expression/ext/normal/8b/2022_get_org.png" style="width:1em; height:1em;" /></span><span class="url-icon"><img alt="[收到]" src="https://face.t.sinajs.cn/t4/appstyle/expression/ext/normal/8b/2022_get_org.png" style="width:1em; height:1em;" /></span><span class="url-icon"><img alt="[收到]" src="https://face.t.sinajs.cn/t4/appstyle/expression/ext/normal/8b/2022_get_org.png" style="width:1em; height:1em;" /></span><a  href="https://m.weibo.cn/search?containerid=231522type%3D1%26t%3D10%26q%3D%23%E7%BB%BF%E8%89%B2%E9%BE%99%E6%B1%9F%23" data-hide=""><span class="surl-text">#绿色龙江#</span></a><br />【大庆油田：向“新”而行，前途“风光”正好】提起大庆，你会想到什么？十有八九是石油。1959年，莽莽荒原上，“松基三井”喷出怒吼的工业油流，石油工人震天的欢呼打破了松嫩平原的宁静，一个世界级大油田横空出世，新中国石油工业翻开新的一页，大庆，这个响亮的名字从此震撼世界。65年后的今天，这座因油田、而生、因油而兴的“老”油田，仍不断迸发出当年那股开拓创新、艰苦创业的闯劲，全力践行双碳战略，发力新能源产业建设，阔步迈出绿色转型的昂扬气势。<a  href="https://weibo.cn/sinaurl?u=http%3A%2F%2Fh5.hljnews.cn%2Fh5%2Fdetail%2Fnormal%2F5904430985331712" data-hide=""><span class=\'url-icon\'><img style=\'width: 1rem;height: 1rem\' src=\'https://h5.sinaimg.cn/upload/2015/09/25/3/timeline_card_small_web_default.png\'></span><span class="surl-text">网页链接</span></a>', 'source': '绿色龙江超话', 'reposts_count': 1, 'comments_count': 0, 'reprint_cmt_count': 0, 'attitudes_count': 0, 'user_name': '黑龙江省生态环境厅', 'user_description': '黑龙江省生态环境厅官方微博', 'user_follow_count': 141, 'user_followers_count': '4.1万', 'user_statuses_count': 19798, 'user_verified': True}
